  "body": [
    "UT MD Anderson provides cancer care at several convenient locations throughout the Greater Houston Area and collaborates with community hospitals and health systems nationwide through our cancer network.",
    "Texas Medical Center",
    "League City",
    "West Houston",
    "The Woodlands",
    "Sugar Land",
    "Northwest Houston Surgical & Specialty Care",
    "Gynecologic Oncology Clinic at The Woman's Hospital of Texas",
    "At more than 160,000 square feet, our Proton Therapy Center offers the most advanced radiation available to treat several different types of cancer. Visit our location just south of the Texas Medical Center and enjoy free on-site parking.",
    "Address: 1840 Old Spanish Trail Houston, TX 77054",
    "Telephone: 1-833-992-0708",
    "Read about our Proton Therapy Center",
    "UT MD Anderson offers diagnostic services in convenient, community-based locations. Diagnostic imaging clinics offer blood draws and preventative screening. A sub-specialized radiologist with expertise on advanced imaging techniques is available at each location.",
    "Learn about our diagnostic imaging clinics",
    "Getting blood drawn before an appointment can reduce clinic delays. UT MD Anderson patients can have their blood taken at any of our Diagnostic Laboratory Centers the day before their visits.",
    "Learn more about our Diagnostic Laboratory Centers",
    "Together with select hospitals and health systems across the globe, UT MD Anderson is advancing our mission to end cancer by improving the quality and accessibility of cancer care in local communities.",
    "Banner MD Anderson Cancer Center Greater Phoenix, AZ; Northern Colorado",
    "Greater Phoenix, AZ; Northern Colorado",
    "Baptist MD Anderson Cancer Center Jacksonville, FL",
    "Jacksonville, FL",
    "Community Health Network MD Anderson Cancer Center Indianapolis, IN",
    "Indianapolis, IN",
    "MD Anderson Cancer Center at Cooper Camden, NJ",
    "Camden, NJ",
    "Ochsner MD Anderson Cancer Center Southeastern Louisiana",
    "Southeastern Louisiana",
    "RUSH MD Anderson Cancer Center Chicago, IL",
    "Chicago, IL",
    "UT Health San Antonio MD Anderson Cancer Center San Antonio, TX",
    "San Antonio, TX",
    "Get information about what you can do to stay safe while at UT MD Anderson.",
    "The MD Anderson Directions app offers driving directions to UT MD Anderson locations and walking directions while you're on campus.",
    "Download the app on the Apple App Store or the Google Play Store.",
    "Are you coming to UT MD Anderson from outside of the United States? Our International Center is here to help you make a smooth transition to Houston and provide support at every step of your cancer journey.",
    "Our patients depend on blood and platelet donations.",
    "Show your support for our mission through branded merchandise.",
